terraform init
terraform validate
terraform plan
terraform apply
After that change the instance-type to t2.medium and save it
terraform apply ------ so here automatically it will destroy the t2.micro server and create a t2.medium server
Next after that destroy the server -------- terraform destroy
Next if you want back up of the server with the instance type t2.medium you can create it through the terraform.tfstate.backup file
cp terraform.tfstate.backup terraform.tfstate ------------ It will copy your instance configurations from backup file to tfstate file and then create your instance by terraform apply.
